---
import Demo from '../layouts/Demo.astro';
import meta from '../demos/log-sentinel/meta';
import Island from '../demos/log-sentinel/Demo.tsx';
---
<Demo meta={meta}>
  <Island client:only="react" />
  <div slot="notes">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>The model judges whether each log entry needs attention, its severity and likely cause. Local rules group related events from the same service into incidents and retain the highest severity.</p>
    <h3>Demo scope</h3>
    <p>The logs and incident storm are synthetic. Model judgments can miss incidents or flag harmless events. Fixture-based results describe this sample stream, not a production monitoring guarantee.</p>
  </div>
</Demo>
